DEBUG:  metadata sync: finished dist object metadata
DEBUG:  metadata sync: starting tenant schema metadata
DEBUG:  metadata sync: finished tenant schema metadata
DEBUG:  metadata sync: starting inter-table relationship
DEBUG:  metadata sync: finished inter-table relationship
 ?column?
